k\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,I,R,\\mathbb I,\\langle M_i:i\\in I\\rangle,\\delta,L\\in V\">\\(C,I,R,\\mathbb I,\\langle M_i:i\\in I\\rangle,\\delta,L\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb I=\\langle I,R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathbb I=\\langle I,R\\rangle\\)</span> is an encoded linear order and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(I,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(I,R)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" href=\"?note=b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec_L\">\\(\\prec_L\\)</span> is elementary substructure in language <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"faf104362ffe13b3\" href=\"?note=faf104362ffe13b3\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md\">../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> are the function and ordinal predicates (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel2ElementaryChain}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel2ElementaryChain}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel5ElementaryChain}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcModel8ElementaryChain}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel5ElementaryChain}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcModel8ElementaryChain}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel9ElementaryChain}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel9ElementaryChain}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model2\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}chain} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel2ElementaryChain}_S(C,\\mathbb I)\\leftrightarrow \\exists I,R,L\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathbb I=\\langle I,R\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(I,R)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(C,I,\\operatorname{ran}(C))\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\to C(i)\\prec_L C(j))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model2\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}chain} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel2ElementaryChain}_S(C,\\mathbb I)\\leftrightarrow \\exists I,R,L\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathbb I=\\langle I,R\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(I,R)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(C,I,\\operatorname{ran}(C))\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\to C(i)\\prec_L C(j))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model2\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}chain} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel5ElementaryChain}_S(I,R,\\langle M_i:i\\in I\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModel2ElementaryChain}_S(\\langle M_i:i\\in I\\rangle,\\langle I,R\\rangle)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model2\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}chain} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel5ElementaryChain}_S(I,R,\\langle M_i:i\\in I\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModel2ElementaryChain}_S(\\langle M_i:i\\in I\\rangle,\\langle I,R\\rangle)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model2\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}chain} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel8ElementaryChain}_S(\\langle M_i:i\\in I\\rangle,I,R)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModel5ElementaryChain}_S(I,R,\\langle M_i:i\\in I\\rangle)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model2\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}chain} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel8ElementaryChain}_S(\\langle M_i:i\\in I\\rangle,I,R)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModel5ElementaryChain}_S(I,R,\\langle M_i:i\\in I\\rangle)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model2\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}chain} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel9ElementaryChain}_S(C,\\delta)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel2ElementaryChain}_S(C,\\langle\\delta,\\in\\cap\\delta^2\\rangle)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model2\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}chain} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel9ElementaryChain}_S(C,\\delta)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel2ElementaryChain}_S(C,\\langle\\delta,\\in\\cap\\delta^2\\rangle)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li>The model5, model8, and mode